{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09554","headline":"辰阳即事 · 张谓","name":"辰阳即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青枫落叶正堪悲，黄菊残花欲待谁。\n水近偏逢寒气早，山深常见日光迟。\n愁中卜命看周易，病里招魂读楚词。\n自恨不如湘浦鴈，春来即是北归时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}